   "updated": 1755000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "This canvas.\nOne example, worked by hand.\nEvery symbol defined before use.\nWhere the idea came from\n(paper, textbook, chapter).\n\nQuestion answered: WHY.",
