   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "An empty file.\nThe same example, in code.\nTests that would catch me lying.\nReal output \u2014 including the\nruns that came out wrong.\n\nQuestion answered: HOW.",
