   "updated": 1755000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "This will not produce ChatGPT. The final model will be small, and it will say\nstrange things.  It will not be fast, and it will not be production code.\n\nWhat it will be: a language model where I can point at any line and tell you\nwhy it's there. That's the deliverable.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "This will not produce ChatGPT. The final model will be small, and it will say\nstrange things.  It will not be fast, and it will not be production code.\n\nWhat it will be: a language model where I can point at any line and tell you\nwhy it's there. That's the deliverable.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
